WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.600
Every service on one page, with its 30-day uptime

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.500
Each server counts what is healthy, down or unknown

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.300
To add a service, open its config.json

4
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.900
Paste the new service in

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.200
Save the file. No restart, no database

6
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.333
Reload the page: the new card is already there

7
00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:30.013
Press / and type to filter by name, product or description

8
00:00:30.013 --> 00:00:33.980
A red border: gatus says this service is down

9
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.380
No data from gatus: unknown, never a false green

10
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.947
Self-hosted, open source, one small Go binary
